-- 0056 · The proof of payment was in the sheet all along
--
-- Generated by scripts/generate-proof-of-payment.py. Do not hand-edit.
--
-- Each bank advice is a hyperlink on the payment reference cell, pointing
-- at a PDF in the company SharePoint. The file name carries the date, the
-- payee, the bank and the amount, so a payment that looked like a bare
-- reference turns out to have a document behind it after all.
--
-- The amount on the advice is not used to set the amount settled: one
-- advice routinely covers several requests, and what the bank paid out
-- that day is a different question from what this request was for.
--
-- Part 2 of 2.

